</span><span begin="0:44.977" end="0:45.337">常</span><span begin="0:45.337" end="0:46.026">忘</span><span begin="0:46.026" end="0:46.502">了</span></p><p begin="0:47.072" end="0:52.783" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:47.072" end="0:48.088">我依</span><span begin="0:48.088" end="0:48.416">然</span><span begin="0:48.416" end="0:49.090">爱</span><span begin="0:49.090" end="0:50.091">着</span><span begin="0:50.091" end="0:52.783">你</span></p></div><div begin="0:53.869" end="1:43.176" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:53.869" end="1:00.131" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:53.869" end="0:54.628">因</span><span begin="0:54.628" end="0:55.078">为</span><span begin="0:55.078" end="0:55.638">爱</span><span begin="0:55.638" end="0:56.407">情</span> <span begin="0:56.859" end="0:57.199">不</span><span begin="0:57.199" end="0:57.547">会</span><span begin="0:57.547" end="0:57.942">轻</span><span begin="0:57.942" end="0:58.292">易</span><span begin="0:58.292" end="0:58.563">悲</span><span begin="0:58.563" end="1:00.131">伤</span></p><p begin="0:59.917" end="1:05.573" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.917" end="1:00.434">所</span><span begin="1:00.434" end="1:00.738">以</span><span begin="1:00.738" end="1:01.042">一</span><span begin="1:01.042" end="1:01.487">切</span><span begin="1:01.487" end="1:01.724">都</span><span begin="1:01.724" end="1:02.052">是</span><span begin="1:02.052" end="1:02.638">幸</span><span begin="1:02.638" end="1:03.092">福</span><span begin="1:03.092" end="1:03.398">的</span><span begin="1:03.398" end="1:03.891">模</span><span begin="1:03.891" end="1:05.573">样</span></p><p begin="1:05.583" end="1:10.866" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:05.583" end="1:06.155">因为</span><span begin="1:06.155" end="1:06.532">爱</span><span begin="1:06.532" end="1:07.821">情</span> <span begin="1:07.821" end="1:08.824">简单的</span><span begin="1:08.824" end="1:09.253">生</span><span begin="1:09.253" end="1:10.866">长</span></p><p begin="1:10.939" end